# Frontend Conventions

## TypeScript
- Always use strict typing — no `any`, no implicit types
- Types for dashboard data go in `types/dashboard.ts`

## Styling
- Use Tailwind utility classes exclusively
- Use custom color tokens (`text-accent-green`, `bg-background-card`, etc.) — never hardcode hex values
- Use `font-mono-display` class for metric values (heart rate, VO2max, steps, etc.)

## Components
- Dashboard-specific components → `components/dashboard/`
- Generic/reusable components → `components/ui/`

## Data Fetching
- All API calls go in `lib/` — never fetch directly inside components
- Use Next.js App Router patterns (server components, `use client` only when needed)
- Never use Pages Router patterns (`getServerSideProps`, `getStaticProps`)
